{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "喪", "id": "喪"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "賈", "id": "賈"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "野人", "id": "野人"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "從", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "從", "target": "喪"}, {"weight": 1.4000876832522264, "source": "從", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "從", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "從", "target": "賈"}, {"weight": 1.1994169877900753, "source": "從", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.585711348909966, "source": "賈", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.4870990602418561, "source": "治", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.8925641683500207, "source": "治", "target": "野人"}, {"weight": 0.3884867715737465, "source": "治", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.4870990602418561, "source": "治", "target": "喪"}, {"weight": 2.2755564206061263, "source": "養", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.681021528714291, "source": "養", "target": "野人"}, {"weight": 3.1918471524802814, "source": "君子", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 3.884994333040227, "source": "君子", "target": "野人"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "喪", "target": "先"}]}}